<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-ZAIRE TO PLAY WORLD CUP MATCH IN ZIMBABWE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZAIRE TO PLAY WORLD CUP MATCH IN ZIMBABWE.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zaire's World Cup qualifying match against Zambia, scheduled for Kinshasa, will be played in Zimbabwe because of the civil war raging at home, FIFA said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The African group three clash, originally scheduled for Sunday, will instead be held on April 9 at the National Sports Stadium in the Zimbabwean capital of Harare.</p>
</text>
